connection requests for about 270 GW, of which 545 requests and 211 GW for large batteries.","source":"https://www.ingenieur.de/technik/fachbereiche/kuenstliche-intelligenz/340-gw-bis-2035-knappe-stromnetze-und-ki-boom/"},{"topic":"demand","text":"The national data-centre strategy (March 2026) aims to at least double data-centre capacity by 2030.","source":"https://www.taylorwessing.com/de/insights-and-events/insights/2026/03/rechenzentrumsstrategie-und-netzpaket"},{"topic":"expansion","text":"SuedLink (about 700 km, 4 GW, about €10bn) and SuedOstLink are planned to run from 2028; the Elbe tunnel for SuedLink was completed in June 2026.","source":"https://www.renewable-energy-industry.com/news/world/article-7625-suedlink-elbe-tunnel-completed-germanys-major-power-highways-approach-2027-28-commissioning"}],"regulation":[{"date":"2021-10","name":"Redispatch 2.0","status":"in_force","what":"All plants from 100 kW, including wind and solar, take part in grid redispatch; curtailed operators are compensated.","source":"https://www.bdew.de/media/documents/RD2.0_Netzbetreiberkoordinierungskonzept_NKK_v1.5.pdf"},{"date":"2025-02","name":"Solarspitzengesetz","status":"in_force","what":"New solar plants get no payment in hours with negative prices; small plants without a smart meter may feed in at most 60 % of their rating.","source":"https://www.topagrar.com/betriebsleitung/news/solarspitzengesetz-kein-geld-bei-negativen-preisen-20014251.html"},{"date":"2025-02","name":"Flexible connection agreements (§ 8a EEG, § 17 (2b) EnWG)","status":"in_force","what":"Grid operators and project owners may agree a capped feed-in, overbuild a connection and share it between plants (cable pooling).","source":"https://www.gleisslutz.com/de/know-how/flexible-netzanschlussvereinbarungen-fca-typische-modelle-und-verhandlungspunkte"},{"date":"2026-04","name":"TSO maturity procedure (Reifegradverfahren)","status":"in_force","what":"The four TSOs rank connection requests by project maturity instead of first come, first served.","source":"https://cms.law/de/deu/legal-updates/netzpaket-2026-neue-regeln-fuer-netzanschluesse-geplant"},{"date":"2026-07","name":"Grid package (Netzpaket) with 'Redispatchvorbehalt'","status":"in_parliament","what":"Cabinet bill of 29 Jul 2026: new plants in capacity-limited grid areas would lose redispatch compensation for a period; ends first come, first served for connections. Hearing on 7 Oct 2026; critics question EU-law compliance.","source":"https://www.roedl.com/insights/netzpaket-light-referentenentwurf/"},{"date":"2026-07","name":"Data centres: waste-heat duty","status":"in_force","what":"New data centres must make at least 10 % of their waste heat usable.","source":"https://www.boerse-express.com/news/articles/rechenzentren-neue-abwaerme-pflicht-ab-juli-und-29-mrd-euro-923350"}]}}